Description: Comprehensive backup wrapper for znapzend
 znapzend-full provides a complete backup solution built on top of znapzend.
 It adds:
  - Backup of EFI partitions and GPT layouts
  - Full ZFS/zpool property backup
  - Hash-based change detection for efficient backups
  - D-Bus service for status monitoring
  - System tray application (Qt)
  - Interactive restore utility
  - CLI control tool for headless systems

Package: znapzend-full-gui
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         znapzend-full,
         python3-pyqt6
Description: GUI components for znapzend-full
 This package provides the graphical user interface components:
  - System tray application
  - Configuration dialog
 .
 Install this on systems with a desktop environment.
